// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO0/4-8/45/48 (dedicated onboard TFT
// display), GPIO2/15-17/47 (I2S audio), GPIO8/18 (internal Wire1 bus
// for mic ADC/DAC/IMU/touch), GPIO46 (audio amp power), GPIO3 (touch
// IRQ) - see vendor pins_arduino.h. MUTE_PIN (GPIO1, a physical button)
// stays kept.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO1 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard MUTE button
// per espressif/arduino-esp32 pins_arduino.h (MUTE_PIN 1) and
// espressif/esp-box hardware overview docs.
